Create [CHARACTER] in [POSE], with [HAIR] and [EXPRESSION]. Use an intentionally stylized face with an oversized rounded head, short lower face, narrow jaw, long thin neck, slightly enlarged ears, large pale oval eyes with tiny off-center pupils, thick horizontal black eyebrows, heavy upper eyelids, subtle mauve under-eye accents, a small broad triangular nose, and a wide asymmetrical grin with individually drawn irregular teeth. Keep the character expressive, strange, playful, and slightly surreal without losing the recognizable qualities of the reference.


