BACKGROUND
Place the character against [BACKGROUND], simplified into large flat graphic shapes with a few loosely drawn environmental details. Add oversized rough hand-painted lettering reading ”MY RULES”. Keep typography partially cropped and integrated into the poster composition.


COMPOSITION
Off-center waist-up framing. Slight camera tilt. Character dominant in the frame. Cropped background typography. Loose poster margins. Lightly weathered printed edges. Strong graphic hierarchy and generous negative space.


STYLE
Contemporary alternative character illustration. Hand-drawn editorial poster. Experimental ink artwork. Retro print aesthetic. Modern graphic design. Flat cel-shaded illustration. Premium art-book quality. Expressive, quirky, stylish, and intentionally imperfect.


NEGATIVE PROMPT
